      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BANDIT MIA (5) has a strong record this track and trip including two wins from four starts. Comes off a (20.60) win last time, scoring by 5 lengths in a Grade 5 over 365m at this track. Looks suited and should go close. ZIPPING GEORGIA (2) had been in super honest form hitting the frame two times on end before finishing fourth (21.32) at this track last time. Has performed well from this box with a win and six minor placings to her name from eight starts. Shapes as one to consider. ZIPPING CHICAGO (1) finds it hard to win. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing second (30.49) at Wentworth Park. Must be included in calculations. BILLY BOIL (8) is building a solid run of minor placings and will play a big role again.",
